WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:17.348
"Uh-oh," Peter said.

2
00:00:17.349 --> 00:00:19.719
"Mrs. Tiggywinkle is gone.

3
00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:23.380
What should we do?"

4
00:00:23.381 --> 00:00:26.317
"Let's play!" Benjamin said.

5
00:00:26.318 --> 00:00:28.499
"We can get my kite."

6
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:33.607
Peter shook his head. "I can't play yet.

7
00:00:33.608 --> 00:00:40.682
Those clothes are still dirty."

8
00:00:40.683 --> 00:00:44.318
"We can wash your clothes!" Benjamin said.

9
00:00:44.319 --> 00:00:46.634
"It's easy."

10
00:00:46.635 --> 00:00:49.912
Peter smiled. "Good idea!

11
00:00:49.913 --> 00:00:58.484
Then we can fly your kite."

12
00:00:58.485 --> 00:01:04.261
The bunnies filled some buckets with water.

13
00:01:04.262 --> 00:01:07.366
They dumped in lots of soap.

14
00:01:07.367 --> 00:01:12.043
Bubbles flew into the air.

15
00:01:12.044 --> 00:01:16.073
"Ahh! I can't see!" Peter cried.

16
00:01:16.074 --> 00:01:20.439
"Be careful!" Benjamin called.

17
00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:22.801
But it was too late.

18
00:01:22.802 --> 00:01:26.918
Peter bumped into some buckets.

19
00:01:26.919 --> 00:01:30.631
Whoosh!

20
00:01:30.632 --> 00:01:38.459
Water and soap spilled everywhere.

21
00:01:38.460 --> 00:01:41.505
"Oh no!" Peter cried.

22
00:01:41.506 --> 00:01:45.184
"Now all the clothes are wet and soapy!"

23
00:01:45.185 --> 00:01:55.226
"I will find a mop," Benjamin said.

24
00:01:55.227 --> 00:01:58.850
"Oops!" Benjamin slipped in the water.

25
00:01:58.851 --> 00:02:02.534
He banged into the table. Crash!

26
00:02:02.535 --> 00:02:05.879
Buckets and clothes flew everywhere.

27
00:02:05.880 --> 00:02:12.160
More soap spilled on the floor.

28
00:02:12.161 --> 00:02:14.468
Peter gulped.

29
00:02:14.469 --> 00:02:18.522
"We made a big mess," he said.

30
00:02:18.523 --> 00:02:20.303
Knock! Knock!

31
00:02:20.305 --> 00:02:24.181
Someone was at the door!
